      "only_terminal_flank_can_go": "K170 and L212/P213/T214 look like dead flank by function, but K170 sits BETWEEN E169 and E171 and L212-P214 sit between L211 and E215. Removing an internal residue changes the spacing that defines the triangle, so it is not flank at all - it is the strut. Only TERMINAL residues can be trimmed without moving a payload. That is why 3 come off, not 6.",
